{
  "slug": "cucumber-and-dill-salad",
  "title": "Cucumber and Dill Salad",
  "blurb": "Crisp cucumber ribbons dressed with fresh dill and a light vinegar dressing",
  "steps": [
    "Use a vegetable peeler to slice the cucumber lengthways into thin ribbons, stopping when you reach the seedy centre.",
    "Place the ribbons in a bowl and sprinkle with the salt, then toss gently and leave for 5 minutes to draw out moisture.",
    "Drain any liquid from the bowl and pat the cucumber ribbons dry with kitchen paper.",
    "Chop the dill finely and add to the cucumber along with the vinegar, olive oil and black pepper.",
    "Toss everything together and serve immediately."
  ],
